Package: rxlsb
Title: Read Excel Binary ('.xlsb') Files via python-calamine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Patrick", "Barks", email = "patrick.barks@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads Excel binary workbook ('.xlsb') files, which 'readxl'
    cannot open, by wrapping the Python package 'python-calamine' through
    'reticulate'. Provides a 'readxl'-style interface with two functions:
    one to read a single sheet into a tibble and one to list sheet names.
    The Python dependency is installed automatically on first use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    reticulate,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.9)
